- provide(:title, "Contact")
.row
  %section.post.title.mx-auto
    %h1 Contact Me!
    %br
  %section.post.content
    %p
      Hello! If you have a question for me, feedback on some of my work, or
      any other reason to contact me, feel free to do so at this address:
      = link_to("tylor@tylorlilley.com", "mailto:tylor@tylorlilley.com") + '.'
      I am not very active on social media, so good old fashioned email is definitely
      the best way you can reach me. That said, I try to respond to any
      emails I receive, so don't hesitate to reach out!
